Package: aegis-dimse-bridge
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libssl3 | libssl1.1, adduser
Maintainer: AEGIS Imaging <ops@aegisimaging.ai>
Homepage: https://aegisimaging.ai
Description: AEGIS DIMSE Bridge — DICOM C-STORE receiver for AEGIS
 The AEGIS DIMSE Bridge accepts DICOM C-STORE associations from local
 PACS, modalities, and workstations on TCP/11112 and securely forwards
 studies to the AEGIS control plane for de-identification, quality
 control, and downstream distribution.
 .
 The bridge is a self-contained PyInstaller bundle: it ships its own
 Python interpreter and DICOM stack, so the only host dependencies are
 libc and OpenSSL.
